c_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TNg0zLfS7YEQ7kNvwFZlGla&_nc_oc=Adm5wns9Lt1hZBKzLxQUwgtPL-hqAwhRPvlSXixUQglKN-pf3USS_T9wEIylJOS2Oiw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuuU_oJQhJBBR0BYkmyoDnMrs-zC17A1gIei74FTH0itA&oe=699DB51F"}, {"file_name": "\u6210\u7e3e_en.png", "id": "1305568201253615", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822800_1305568204586948_6647554989950197956_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=39Xx3GLW0gYQ7kNvwEdDOfC&_nc_oc=AdkICQsHcwWRuMn0IKu0z2FUIBcNK7rwSSJtweqFTKXJOxs4Je7E4q4tVbqlsNOTr8s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvuT9Ck7e7QfNDhg0Pn4kGVWEbofGjgFEXLaT-TF0UNiA&oe=699D9B03"}, {"file_name": "\u87a2\u5e55\u622a\u5716_005_en.png", "id": "1316589686744004", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824213_1316589690077337_6407229494548091322_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=82jfeNnkbA0Q7kNvwG6fAUa&_nc_oc=AdliG3Pr_qx6k2AfXxxulk3kMVcF_8LLga-tLXIgV4s_-YpJx9aooEquzQ4a6weMSs4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftHmkexn_ULeZprYDhPmtrzrybR6wX3gbPlGv2POxOkYA&oe=699DB4EE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\u5fc3\u52d5\u5373\u6551\uff1aCPR+AED MR\u8a13\u7df4\uff08\u7f8e\u570b\u7248\uff09(1920x1080)2m.png", "id": "1508236407193924", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821881_1508236413860590_6901290350086078181_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=23D4kS-43ZsQ7kNvwF__yVG&_nc_oc=AdlQrIWrfEjHFOYyg9fMS3Y-p7lLEV8rUf1ddEbosuAmHCmEWuW9JRYtAhC-zPHTHJM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuie37651t1iM6rU4Aa8xkOlwRP_Lj0c9tGLznWSIe9Ag&oe=699D7ED9"}, "display_name": "Heartbeat Rescue: CPR+AED MR (Pro, KR)", "keywords": ["AED", "CPR", "training", "emergency", "resuscitation"], "long_description": "# Ideal for first-time learners of CPR and AED\nStep-by-step guidance explains the emergency process and builds proper reactions.\n\n**Simulates the Full Rescue Procedure (Latest Guidelines)**\n\nBased on the latest AHA CPR guidelines, integrating international practices and U.S. standards:\n- Check (responsiveness & breathing) \u2192 Call (dial 911 & get AED) \u2192 Compress (chest compressions) \u2192 Shock (use AED)\n- Clear instructions minimize frustration for beginners.\n- Sequential teaching builds understanding and muscle memory.\n- Prepares users to stay calm and respond correctly.\n\n\n**Multilingual Voice & Interface Support**\n- Global training support with easy language switching.\n- Cuts translation costs and improves accessibility.\n\n\n**Real-Time Compression Feedback**\n- Visual and auditory feedback shows depth and rhythm.\n- Rhythm cues guide proper rate, simulating real-life needs.\n\n\n**\u201cTest Mode\u201d for Real-Life Simulation**\n- Visual prompts removed; audio only.\n- Tests CPR familiarity under pressure, simulating emergencies.\n\n\n**Comprehensive Performance Evaluation**\n- Real-time scoring with online record access.\n- Supports tracking progress and targeted improvement.\n\n\n**Group Training & Backend Management**\n- Multi-user sessions with individual records.\n- Backend generates summaries and visual reports.\n- Helps admins monitor and adjust training.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 **Subscription-based service. For full features, use with a stable internet connection.**\n\n\ud83d\udce9 Contact us: huagingofficial@gmail.com", "short_description": "Ideal for first-time CPR and AED learners.\nStep-by-step guidance explains the emergency process and builds proper response skills. Based on the latest AHA guidelines, this version suits schools, companies, instructors, and group training. \nIt offers a complete learning and assessment system with flexibility. This is a subscription service; for full access and best performance, please connect to a stable internet.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.huaging.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url"